      "category": "etymology",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "The Santa Maria de Acoma Mission, a 1933 Spanish Colonial stone church with two square towers, hosts an annual feast honoring the Virgin Mary each May.",
